{"time": 1755767972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138050230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“无需担忧，像这样的魔术，本大爷轻轻松松就能破坏掉”一副自大的表情"}
{"time": 1755768011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976295721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "（可以）"}
{"time": 1755768013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34160299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“山田先生已经破解了吗？”"}
{"time": 1755768087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160926209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“没错，就像撕破一条丝巾一样。想必是什么水镜一类的无聊魔术吧”"}
{"time": 1755768103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133564191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "*眼皮抽搐"}
