{"time": 1756124708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949610049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“汝为何人？不是为吾等献上演出之人吗？”"}
{"time": 1756124878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1416959516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“干……干什么了？”对方有些没反应过来，看了看手表“啊……该开始准备今晚的演出了，怎么大家衣服都没换？”"}
{"time": 1756125030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1653980600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“尔等是何时来到此地的？汝先前记忆停留于何处？”"}
{"time": 1756193492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359169791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "903910689", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1653980600]“呃……今天早晨，我们来这边，打算彩排晚上的剧目……喂，都醒醒醒醒”*那个人转过身去拍其他的演员“一个多小时前，我们还在后台做准备”"}
